---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service – Astro SaaS Launcher">

<section class="py-40 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6">

    <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[0.9] text-[#0F172A] mb-12">
      Terms of Service<br />
      <span class="inline-block -rotate-1 px-3 bg-[#FF5F7E] text-white">
        Please read carefully.
      </span>
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-xl max-w-none text-[#1E293B]">

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Astro SaaS Launcher (“we”, “our”, “us”) provides a downloadable software product designed to help developers launch SaaS applications faster. By purchasing, downloading, or using this product, you agree to these Terms of Service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">2. License</h2>
      <p>
        When you purchase Astro SaaS Launcher, you receive a non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the source code for your own projects. You may modify the code for personal or commercial use.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may <strong>not</strong> redistribute, resell, or sublicense the product, whether modified or unmodified.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">3. Payments</h2>
      <p>
        All payments are processed securely through Stripe. Prices are listed in GBP (£). Once payment is completed, you will receive access to the product files.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">4. Refund Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We offer a 14‑day money‑back guarantee. If you are not satisfied, contact us within 14 days of purchase for a full refund.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">5. Updates</h2>
      <p>
        Your purchase includes lifetime updates to the product. We may add features, fix bugs, or improve the codebase at any time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">6. Prohibited Use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reselling or redistributing the product</li>
        <li>Claiming the product as your own original work</li>
        <li>Using the product for illegal or harmful activities</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">7. Liability</h2>
      <p>
        The product is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages, losses, or issues arising from the use of the product.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-black text-3xl">8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about these terms, please contact us via the contact form.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

